WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.933
Tens and ones

2
00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:10.967
Grandma ties sticks in bundles of ten. Counting bundles makes big numbers easy.

3
00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:15.167
There are three bundles of ten and four single sticks.

4
00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:18.100
Three tens are thirty.

5
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.667
Thirty and four is thirty-four.
